    "detailed_description": "&quot;CLONY&quot; is a <strong>gravity-defying Sokoban-style 2D puzzle game</strong>.<br><br>The player can create <strong>clones</strong> above their head.<br>All clones move in the same direction as the player.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/5043d09bd381dcc7f6c282d8d8faa888.poster.avif?t=1736950857\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/5043d09bd381dcc7f6c282d8d8faa888.webm?t=1736950857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/5043d09bd381dcc7f6c282d8d8faa888.mp4?t=1736950857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br><br>If all yellow buttons can be pressed at the same time, the game is clear.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/2764b1574fdb665b3b81ca532345cef4.poster.avif?t=1736950857\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/2764b1574fdb665b3b81ca532345cef4.webm?t=1736950857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/2764b1574fdb665b3b81ca532345cef4.mp4?t=1736950857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br><br>There are boxes to push, players to swap positions, gravity to flip, and floors to get stuck ... Various gimmicks are provided, and the difficulty level is challenging to solve.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/5cbb4c80e654ba2ac67d5f7d1d2dfa79.poster.avif?t=1736950857\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/5cbb4c80e654ba2ac67d5f7d1d2dfa79.webm?t=1736950857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/5cbb4c80e654ba2ac67d5f7d1d2dfa79.mp4?t=1736950857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>There are 45 puzzles in total, and no stage is designed to be just large or cumbersome, but rather minimalistic to maximize enjoyment.<br><br>Enjoy the world of CLONY while also being soothed by the space-inspired artwork and sounds.",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;CLONY&quot; is a <strong>gravity-defying Sokoban-style 2D puzzle game</strong>.<br><br>The player can create <strong>clones</strong> above their head.<br>All clones move in the same direction as the player.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/5043d09bd381dcc7f6c282d8d8faa888.poster.avif?t=1736950857\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/5043d09bd381dcc7f6c282d8d8faa888.webm?t=1736950857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/5043d09bd381dcc7f6c282d8d8faa888.mp4?t=1736950857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br><br>If all yellow buttons can be pressed at the same time, the game is clear.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/2764b1574fdb665b3b81ca532345cef4.poster.avif?t=1736950857\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/2764b1574fdb665b3b81ca532345cef4.webm?t=1736950857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/2764b1574fdb665b3b81ca532345cef4.mp4?t=1736950857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br><br>There are boxes to push, players to swap positions, gravity to flip, and floors to get stuck ... Various gimmicks are provided, and the difficulty level is challenging to solve.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/5cbb4c80e654ba2ac67d5f7d1d2dfa79.poster.avif?t=1736950857\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/5cbb4c80e654ba2ac67d5f7d1d2dfa79.webm?t=1736950857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953590/extras/5cbb4c80e654ba2ac67d5f7d1d2dfa79.mp4?t=1736950857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>There are 45 puzzles in total, and no stage is designed to be just large or cumbersome, but rather minimalistic to maximize enjoyment.<br><br>Enjoy the world of CLONY while also being soothed by the space-inspired artwork and sounds.",
